2003-03-05  Luc Moreau  <L.Moreau@ecs.soton.ac.uk>

	* ivory_runtime.cpp: defined a cellInfo constructor that takes a icode_label.

	* parse.cpp: introduced a table of absoluted offset,

	* exec.h (_levaluate2,_revaluate2): had to fix spA(x) mode and had to multiply
